  "text": "Unplanned Comparisons Unplanned Comparisons Post Hoc Comparisons When the comparison among means is decided on after viewing the data, the comparison is called an \"unplanned comparison\" or a post-hoc comparison. Different statistical tests are required for unplanned comparisons than for planned comparisons .",
